ted (src, dst) pairs between adjacent regions.\"\"\"\n453:    \"\"\"Return (n_markers, n_normal, n_colored) or None if infeasible.\"\"\"\n473:    \"\"\"Find all valid (center, stem) for placing a T marker from src toward dst.\"\"\"\n514:    \"\"\"Update occupied_cells and occupied_neighbors after placing a marker.\"\"\"\n538:    \"\"\"Map region ids to colors via vectorized lookup.\"\"\"\n544:    \"\"\"Write T-marker cells onto the input grid.\"\"\"\n556:    \"\"\"Fill marker cells in the output grid with the source region's final color.\"\"\"\n566:    \"\"\"Attempt to place a 5-cell L9 marker; return orientation string or None.\"\"\"\n700:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\nFILE:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/8a6d367c.py\n51:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n52:    \"\"\"\n67:    \"\"\"\n251:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
